{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/ed4bcc988078f40a3a7ffd04d7406161.avif?t=1768924104\" width=620 height=171 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/163f9527dbd4a904c0d1151e9133457a.avif?t=1768924104\" width=639 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been several years since Harley Leger left New Bretagne and headed west, hoping to leave the past behind and make her way as a freelance writer. After arriving in the sleepy border town of Rosewater, a seemingly trivial assignment for the local paper leads to the hunt for a missing man's fortune\u2014and the story of the century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harley and her ragtag posse embark on a harrowing journey across Western Vespuccia, encountering bandits, rebels, visionaries, eccentrics, and many more friends and foes on their quest for fame and riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.poster.avif?t=1768924104\" width=574 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.webm?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.mp4?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/ed6dc7a46ca26df282f3b34d64e3918e.avif?t=1768924104\" width=639 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling treasure hunt with 5 travel companions. Choices matter, relationships with your companions affect the trajectory of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory is back, but logical, streamlined, and easy to use\u2014no banging things together to see what sticks. Many situations have multiple solutions based on play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized encounter storylets on your journey, with different situations and outcomes that depend on your previous choices and available resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully rotoscoped animations and cinematic closeups emphasize the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High resolution 1280x720 graphics (yes, that's 720p!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full music score by Lamplight City composer Mark Benis, featuring live instruments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 60 characters, voiced by a star-studded cast of professional voice actors including Cissy Jones (<i>Firewatch, Call of the Sea</i>) Dave Fennoy (<i>The Walking Dead</i>) Roger Clark (<i>Red Dead Redemption 2</i>) and many more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/2c479c4231154101a2fd5715d8692407.poster.avif?t=1768924104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/2c479c4231154101a2fd5715d8692407.webm?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/2c479c4231154101a2fd5715d8692407.mp4?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Time and Punishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/eed5e5795c2c75dbce374215c79344bce39e3019.jpg"},{"name":"Crackshot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/8ea77b32f9455806ee51f9b8405fd4af9b0d8974.jpg"},{"name":"Gunslinger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/cea871a4a808fa2905e177daffe89231df483528.jpg"},{"name":"Sharpshooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/a5a084a514a8a8df6be627eb4e1ebeff90ac7a2d.jpg"},{"name":"Heck of A Hangover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/077bd691a1f8232cbe1529dba974053004592e6a.jpg"},{"name":"Once Upon A Time In Western Vespuccia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/3a8da3132882727d2fa9614b25266bc337bac147.jpg"},{"name":"Duck, You Sucker!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/8b5cbf07ed8729014a5e558f8b8ed7f59a351d49.jpg"},{"name":"The Magnificent Six","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/3b8faf3fc4384974978bcbcef4d0dc327583307a.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodthirsty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/3f88c65b0f04ccc5b9ce437e8e77e1f28fc3373e.jpg"},{"name":"Sneaky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226670/b52f2f814a52564348bb5de11cabbe74555f9dc5.jpg"}],"total":65},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1226670?t=1768924104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768924104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768924104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768924104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1392640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/ed4bcc988078f40a3a7ffd04d7406161.avif?t=1768924104\" width=620 height=171 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/163f9527dbd4a904c0d1151e9133457a.avif?t=1768924104\" width=639 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been several years since Harley Leger left New Bretagne and headed west, hoping to leave the past behind and make her way as a freelance writer. After arriving in the sleepy border town of Rosewater, a seemingly trivial assignment for the local paper leads to the hunt for a missing man's fortune\u2014and the story of the century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harley and her ragtag posse embark on a harrowing journey across Western Vespuccia, encountering bandits, rebels, visionaries, eccentrics, and many more friends and foes on their quest for fame and riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.poster.avif?t=1768924104\" width=574 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.webm?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/d0d07cb1abaa3efd47ba1852001bdc8b.mp4?t=1768924104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226670/extras/ed6dc7a46ca26df282f3b34d64e3918e.avif?t=1768924104\" width=639 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling treasure hunt with 5 travel companions. Choices matter, relationships with your companions affect the trajectory of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory is back, but logical, streamlined, and easy to use\u2014no banging things together to see what sticks. Many situations have multiple solutions based on play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized encounter storylets on your journey, with different situations and outcomes that depend on your previous choices and available resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully rotoscoped animations and cinematic closeups emphasize the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High resolution 1280x720 graphics (yes, that's 720p!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full music score by Lamplight City composer Mark Benis, featuring live instruments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 60 characters, voiced by a star-studded cast of professional voice actors including Cissy Jones (<i>Firewatch, Call of the Sea</i>) Dave Fennoy (<i>The Walking Dead</i>) Roger Clark (<i>Red Dead Redemption 2</i>) and many more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas